            "detailed_description": "The castle is calling! Play as the lovely Anabel, whose father, Henry, disappeared several years ago. Now he’s calling to you in your dreams and needs your help. Travel back to your hometown to save your father and uncover the secrets of Midnight Castle! A batty sidekick, a variety of hidden-object puzzles, morphing objects, Rube Goldberg-style super puzzles, and tons of collectibles make this a not-to-be-missed adventure! Fans of the blockbuster game Midnight Castle will thrill to this Elephant Games’ prequel!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSave Midnight Castle from a new danger in the bonus game!<br />\r\nReplay your favorite hidden-object puzzles and mini-games!<br />\r\nEnjoy exclusive wallpapers, concept art, and the soundtrack!<br />\r\nUncover all the secrets with the available Strategy Guide!",
